                                "sense_id": "8b48a723-7b0a-311a-9c71-f1c41cfd9c25",
                                "text": "In the foyer, a game of Twister has started. It's appealing because all of the women are wearing lowriders. I carefully step over somebody's ass crack and start to look for Lamb."
