                                "sense_id": "8b48a723-7b0a-311a-9c71-f1c41cfd9c25",
                                "text": "No sense even trying to resist the pull of that voice, not when he was talking about secrets and sitting so close and wearing lowriders she wanted to ease off with her teeth."
